1231.80|Keep in mind, when a chicken lays an egg,
1234.90|in that egg is everything it takes to make a chick.
1238.92|While that egg is incubating, the little chicken inside
1242.38|isn't ordering out for takeout food.
1245.92|Everything it takes to make a beak, and eyes, and a liver, and feet
1250.40|is inside that egg.
1278.20|Chicken eggs are among the very highest sources of cholesterol.
1290.28|About half the cholesterol in the foods you eat goes into your bloodstream,
1295.66|and when it goes in, it increases your risk of heart problems.
1298.10|So I would take that egg and set it aside.
1301.62|I would leave it alone. You don't need that.
